<div class="kpi"><span>Schools</span><strong>50</strong></div>
<div class="kpi"><span>Need field visit</span><strong>7</strong></div>
<div class="kpi"><span>Practice sites</span><strong>5</strong></div>
<div class="kpi"><span>Data gaps</span><strong>4</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="map">
