<section id="edtech-dashboard" class="screen">
<div class="topbar"><h2>EdTech Partner Dashboard</h2><span class="role">Product improvement view</span></div>
<table>
<tr><th>Classroom Signal</th><th>Product Interpretation</th><th>Possible Product Response</th></tr>
<tr><td>Students complete videos but struggle with application.</td><td>Exposure is not converting into transfer.</td><td>Add teacher guide and post-video task prompts.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pair work improves explanation where devices are limited.</td><td>Shared-device mode matters.</td><td>Design pair/group workflow.</td></tr>
